# VIS-001 — experiment-local ignores.
#
# The scientific artifacts of this experiment are its code, its manifests, its
# preregistration and its aggregated report. Raw camera imagery, model weights
# and per-run outputs are NOT committed: they are large, they are reproducible
# from the pipeline, and (in the case of imagery) they may contain incidental
# images of people who never consented to being stored in a public repository.

# --- Raw public camera imagery (never committed) ---------------------------
data/raw/
data/frames/

# --- Per-run outputs (predictions, metrics, verdict, report) ---------------
outputs/

# --- Model weights and inference caches ------------------------------------
weights/
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx

# --- Annotated previews / crops (may contain people; keep local) -----------
previews/
crops/
*_annotated.jpg
*_annotated.png

# --- Resolved source probes (environment-specific, regenerated) ------------
data/source_resolution.json

# --- Experiment-local virtualenv -------------------------------------------
.venv-vis001/
